                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.26444/2611.26444v1/assets/m2a_planet.png",
                "caption": "Figure 9:Overview of the model profile card.The card reads from top to bottom, as on the project website.Results by viewgives the success rate in each view.Where failures breakandWhich side failedgive the step at which failed episodes first break down and whetherMind,Actor their composition failed.First failuresandWhere tasks breakgive the most frequent failure codes and where typical tasks stop.Modelgives a four-letter behavioral profile (AppendixE.6).Capability profileandUnder pressuregive the success of each task at Easy, Medium and Hard, grouped by capability and view, and the success rate by difficulty.What could helpturns the codes into directions for improvement. The numbers are an illustrative example; the measured cards of three representative systems are given in AppendixE.4.",
